<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>케이제이다이나텍 | 부분방전 스쿨 특별 모집</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Phosphor Icons -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/@phosphor-icons/web"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts (Pretendard) -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" as="style" crossorigin href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css" />
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
        }
        .gradient-text {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #2dd4bf 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .gradient-bg {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
        }
        .highlight-bg {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #0ea5e9 100%);
        }
        /* Custom Scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #f1f1f1; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #94a3b8; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-800 antialiased">

    <!-- Header / Navbar -->
    <header class="fixed w-full top-0 z-50 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <i class="ph-fill ph-lightning text-blue-600 text-2xl"></i>
                <span class="font-bold text-xl tracking-tight text-slate-900">케이제이다이나텍</span>
            </div>
            <a href="#apply" class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-all bg-blue-600 rounded-full hover:bg-blue-700 hover:shadow-lg">
                지금 신청하기
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center">
        <div class="inline-block mb-4 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 text-blue-700 font-semibold text-sm animate-pulse">
            🔥 2026.2.12 대개강 | 한정 인원 모집 중
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
            엔지니어링의 한계를 넘다.<br>
            <span class="gradient-text">상위 1% 실무자</span>를 위한 비밀 무기
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-600 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
            기술력은 장비가 증명합니다. 하지만 그 장비를 비즈니스 성과로 바꾸는 것은 <strong>'당신의 능력'</strong>입니다. 
            AI와 압도적 실무 스킬로 무장할 단 5번의 기회를 놓치지 마세요.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
            <a href="#apply" class="highlight-bg text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
                부분방전 스쿨 수강신청 🚀
            </a>
            <a href="#curriculum" class="bg-white text-slate-700 font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all duration-300">
                커리큘럼 확인하기
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Company Tech Section -->
    <section class="py-20 gradient-bg text-white px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">전력 설비 진단의 새로운 표준</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg">케이제이다이나텍이 이끄는 압도적인 3대 핵심 기술 라인업</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <!-- Tech 1 -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 p-8 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-sm hover:border-blue-500 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-blue-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
                        <i class="ph ph-wave-sawtooth text-3xl text-blue-400"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">부분방전 측정장비</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">미세한 방전 신호까지 정확하게 포착하여 대형 사고를 미연에 방지하는 초정밀 측정 기술력.</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Tech 2 -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 p-8 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-sm hover:border-teal-500 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-teal-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
                        <i class="ph ph-monitor-pulse text-3xl text-teal-400"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">발전기 온라인 감시장치</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">24시간 멈추지 않는 실시간 모니터링 시스템으로 핵심 설비의 안정적인 운영을 보장합니다.</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Tech 3 -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 p-8 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-sm hover:border-orange-500 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-orange-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
                        <i class="ph ph-shield-check text-3xl text-orange-400"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">활선예방진단</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">설비 가동 중단 없이 안전하게 상태를 진단하여 경제적 손실을 최소화하는 혁신적인 예방 솔루션.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Bridge Section -->
    <section class="py-24 bg-white px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 leading-tight">
                최고의 하드웨어에는,<br>
                <span class="text-blue-600">최고의 두뇌(Expert)</span>가 필요합니다.
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
                케이제이다이나텍은 최고의 진단 장비를 만듭니다. 하지만 이 기술을 세상에 알리고, 
                수주를 따내며, 비즈니스를 확장하는 것은 결국 <strong>'사람'</strong>의 몫입니다.<br><br>
                엔지니어링 지식만으로는 부족한 시대.<br>
                기획, 마케팅, 자동화까지 AI로 무장하여 압도적인 퍼포먼스를 내는 핵심 인재 양성 프로젝트, 
                <strong class="text-slate-900 font-bold">부분방전 스쿨</strong>을 시작합니다.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Offer & Details -->
    <section class="py-16 bg-blue-50 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-y border-blue-100">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 items-center">
            <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531482615713-2afd69097998?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="교육 이미지" class="rounded-2xl shadow-2xl object-cover h-[400px] w-full" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/1000x800/2563eb/white?text=Expert+Training'">
            </div>
            <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-slate-900">부분방전 스쿨 모집 요강</h2>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
                            <i class="ph ph-calendar-blank text-blue-600 text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 mb-1">접수기간</p>
                            <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800">2026. 1. 26 ~ 1. 30 <span class="text-red-500 text-sm ml-2">(마감 임박)</span></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
                            <i class="ph ph-clock text-blue-600 text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 mb-1">교육일정 및 시간</p>
                            <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800">2026. 2. 12 ~ 3. 19 (총 5회)</p>
                            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-1">매주 목요일 저녁 9시 ~ 11시</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
                            <i class="ph ph-video-camera text-blue-600 text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 mb-1">교육방법</p>
                            <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800">원격 Zoom (구글미트) + 실습 위주</p>
                            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-1">어디서든 편안하게 접속하세요.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
                            <i class="ph ph-target text-blue-600 text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 mb-1">교육목적</p>
                            <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800">핵심 전문 강의를 통한 전문가(Expert) 훈련</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Curriculum Section -->
    <section id="curriculum" class="py-24 bg-white px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold tracking-wider uppercase text-sm mb-2 block">Curriculum</span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">AI & 비즈니스 압축 8대 과정</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg">퇴근 시간을 앞당기고 성과는 10배로 늘려줄 실무 밀착형 커리큘럼입니다.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                <!-- Course 1 -->
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-blue-500 transform origin-left scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
                    <div class="text-4xl mb-4">📑</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-slate-800">정부과제 마스터</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">회사 정부과제 사업계획서, 더 이상 두렵지 않은 전문가 되기</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Course 2 -->
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-red-500 transform origin-left scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
                    <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🎬</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-slate-800">유튜브 CF 제작</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">우수한 회사 제품, 직접 유튜브 CF 동영상으로 기획 및 제작하기</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Course 3 -->
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-green-500 transform origin-left scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
                    <div class="text-4xl mb-4">📚</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-slate-800">내 이름으로 출판</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">AI로 5주 만에 교보문고에 내 이름으로 당당히 전자책 출간하기</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Course 4 -->
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-indigo-500 transform origin-left scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
                    <div class="text-4xl mb-4">💻</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-slate-800">랜딩페이지 1시간 컷</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">초보자도 AI로 회사 홈페이지 랜딩페이지를 1시간 만에 완성</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Course 5 -->
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-purple-500 transform origin-left scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
                    <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🤖</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-slate-800">AI 에이전트 구축</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">단순 반복 업무는 끝. 나만의 AI 업무 자동화 에이전트 완성하기</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Course 6 -->
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-yellow-500 transform origin-left scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
                    <div class="text-4xl mb-4">📝</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-slate-800">초고속 제안서 작성</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Notebook LM을 활용하여 복잡한 제안서와 강의자료 뚝딱 만들기</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Course 7 -->
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-cyan-500 transform origin-left scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
                    <div class="text-4xl mb-4">☁️</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-slate-800">구글 워크스페이스</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">생초보를 위한 완벽 가이드 (이메일, 드라이브, 제미나이 정복)</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Course 8 -->
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-pink-500 transform origin-left scale-x-0 group-hover:scale-x-100 transition-transform duration-300"></div>
                    <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🎨</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-slate-800">초격차 홍보영상</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">미드저니, 캔바, 제미나이를 활용하여 압도적인 회사 홍보영상 만들기</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA & Form Section -->
    <section id="apply" class="py-24 gradient-bg relative px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 overflow-hidden">
        <!-- Decorative bg -->
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full max-w-4xl h-full bg-blue-500/10 blur-3xl rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
        
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto relative z-10">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row">
                <!-- Left: Urgency Copy -->
                <div class="bg-blue-600 p-10 text-white md:w-2/5 flex flex-col justify-center">
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 leading-snug">지금 신청하지 않으면<br>도태되는 AI 시대</h3>
                    <p class="text-blue-100 mb-8 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        소수의 인원만 선발하여 진행되는 실무 밀착형 과정입니다. 
                        수강 정원 초과 시 조기 마감될 수 있습니다. 
                        엔지니어의 틀을 깨고 <strong>마스터(Expert)</strong>로 거듭날 당신을 기다립니다.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold bg-blue-700/50 p-3 rounded-lg w-fit">
                        <i class="ph-fill ph-warning-circle text-yellow-300 text-lg"></i>
                        <span>접수 마감: 2026. 1. 30 (금)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Right: Form -->
                <div class="p-10 md:w-3/5 bg-white">
                    <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">수강 신청서 작성</h4>
                    <form id="registrationForm" class="space-y-5" onsubmit="handleFormSubmit(event)">
                        <div>
                            <label for="name" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1">성명 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                            <input type="text" id="name" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all" placeholder="홍길동">
                        </div>
                        
                        <div>
                            <label for="phone" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1">연락처 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                            <input type="tel" id="phone" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all" placeholder="010-0000-0000">
                        </div>
                        
                        <div>
                            <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1">이메일 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                            <input type="email" id="email" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all" placeholder="example@email.com">
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label for="course" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1">참가과정 선택 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                            <select id="course" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all text-slate-700">
                                <option value="" disabled selected>과정을 선택해주세요</option>
                                <option value="all">[통합] 부분방전 스쿨 8대 과정 전체 수강</option>
                                <option value="ai_business">AI 비즈니스 핵심 과정 (1~4강)</option>
                                <option value="ai_marketing">AI 마케팅 & 자동화 과정 (5~8강)</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <button type="submit" class="w-full highlight-bg text-white font-bold text-lg py-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:opacity-90 transition-all mt-4">
                            참가 신청 완료하기
                        </button>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 py-8 text-center text-sm border-t border-slate-800">
        <p class="mb-2">케이제이다이나텍 | 대표전화: 02-000-0000 | 이메일: info@kjdynatech.com</p>
        <p>&copy; 2026 KJ DYNATECH. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

    <!-- Custom Modal Message Box (Instead of alert()) -->
    <div id="customModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[100] hidden flex items-center justify-center px-4 bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-sm opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 max-w-sm w-full shadow-2xl transform scale-95 transition-transform duration-300" id="modalContent">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
                <i class="ph ph-check-circle text-4xl text-green-600"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-center text-slate-900 mb-2">신청이 완료되었습니다!</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-center text-sm mb-6">
                부분방전 스쿨에 지원해 주셔서 감사합니다.<br>입력하신 연락처로 개별 안내를 도와드리겠습니다.
            </p>
            <button onclick="closeModal()" class="w-full bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors">
                확인
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- JavaScript -->
    <script>
        // Form Submission Handler
        function handleFormSubmit(event) {
            event.preventDefault(); // Prevent page reload
            
            // Logic to collect data (just for demonstration)
            const name = document.getElementById('name').value;
            const phone = document.getElementById('phone').value;
            const email = document.getElementById('email').value;
            const course = document.getElementById('course').value;

            // Optional: Send data to server via fetch/axios here
            // console.log({ name, phone, email, course });

            // Show custom modal instead of alert()
            showModal();
            
            // Reset form
            document.getElementById('registrationForm').reset();
        }

        // Modal Logic
        const modal = document.getElementById('customModal');
        const modalContent = document.getElementById('modalContent');

        function showModal() {
            modal.classList.remove('hidden');
            // Small delay to allow CSS transition to work
            setTimeout(() => {
                modal.classList.remove('opacity-0');
                modalContent.classList.remove('scale-95');
            }, 10);
        }

        function closeModal() {
            modal.classList.add('opacity-0');
            modalContent.classList.add('scale-95');
            // Wait for transition to finish before hiding
            setTimeout(() => {
                modal.classList.add('hidden');
            }, 300);
        }

        // Close modal when clicking outside of it
        modal.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
            if (e.target === modal) {
                closeModal();
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
